1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
To abhi bhi bhai tokens ki tension le rahe ho?

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:05,560
Bhai, Meta ne apna naya AI launch kar diya, jiska naam hai Muse AI.

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:11,480
Isse aap das minute, bees minute, yahan tak ki aadhe-aadhe ghante se lambe video generate karwa sakte ho.

4
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,560
Aur iski ek bahut hi badi khaasiyat

5
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:16,680
ki is mein aapko 1 billion tokens bilkul free milenge.

6
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:17,960
Jaanna chahte ho kaise?

7
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:22,480
Kuch nahi, bas aapko apne laptop pe aa jaana hai, aapko Chrome pe jaakar ye ek extension download kar lena hai.

8
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:27,640
Phir is extension ke upar mein ye location daal ke, aapko ye website khol leni hai.

9
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:30,120
Aapko fatafat apna account login karna hai.

10
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,880
Aur referral mein ye code daalna hai.

11
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:35,800
Aur kuch hi seconds mein aapke account mein 1 billion tokens aa jaayenge.

12
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:41,040
Aap chahe aap isse automate tasks karao, ya video editing karao, video generation karao,

13
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:45,760
Ye ek saal tak aapke bilkul aaram se chalenge, aur ye bilkul free mein mil raha hai.

14
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:49,320
Pata nahi ye Meta offer kab tak rakhne wala hai, jaldi fatafat redeem kar lo.
